<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabobank upgrades Fortis stock outlook.</title>
<headline>Rabobank upgrades Fortis stock outlook.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of February research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Fortis Amev     Insurance     69.20   Rabobank Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY (Reiterated). Stock price outlook upgraded to 90 guilders/shr from 80. Fortis, jointly owned by Fortis Amev and Fortis AG, has strong position in Belgium and Netherlands. For Amev average EPS growth seen at 11 percent for 1996-2000, out-pacing AEX (long-term profit growth 8.5 pct). 1997 P/E at 13.8 is lower than AEX (15.3). Amev undervalued and price target for end-1997 is 90 guilders/shr.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):    EPS	  P/E	    Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	 3.85	 18.0	    1.68</p>
<p>    1996		    4.40	 15.7	    1.92</p>
<p>    1997		    5.00	 13.8	    2.17</p>
<p>    1998		    5.55	 12.5	    2.42</p>
<p>    1999		    6.20	 11.2	    2.70</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
